                    This coffee packaging project was my BA thesis, created to make Capitano&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/istockphoto-1809262685.png" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p class="" data-start="347" data-end="616">This coffee packaging project was my BA thesis, created to make Capitano stand out with bold illustrations and a unique color palette. The brand is inspired by a fictional captain, sailing in search of the world’s finest coffee.</p>
<p class="" data-start="618" data-end="908">Each illustration tells part of his story and highlights a different brewing method. The visual style draws from 9th–10th century Nishapur ceramics, giving the brand a sense of cultural richness and authenticity. Bright colors and a clean white background make it eye-catching on the shelf.</p>
